{"ref":"BDB, גּוֹזָל","hw":"גּוֹזָל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹזָל</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong><sup><a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.11\">Dt 32:11</a></sup> <strong>young of birds (</strong>Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܽܘܓܰܠ</span>, cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جَوْزَلٌ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">וְתֹר וְגוֹזָלֽ׃</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:9\" href=\"/Genesis.15.9\">Gn 15:9</a> pigeon; <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹזָלָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.11\">Dt 32:11</a> eaglet (suff. ref. to <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶשֶׁר</span>).","next":"BDB, גזם","prev":"BDB, גזל"}